WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Recruitment events still run on CVs and job ads. AI writes both now. Everyone sounds hireable.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A bad hire in Finland can cost tens of thousands. An open role can sit for months.

3
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
CommonGround. The first conversation worth showing up for.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Meet Robin. Harbor needs incident support. Fictional people. Real problem.

5
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Twins from evidence you approve. Run real work. Matches are common ground. Gaps become questions.

6
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Robin has the incident. Not the data check. The agenda isn’t a score.

7
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Companies get signal. Talent walk in prepared. Espoo’s events feel like quality.

8
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Try it in the browser. One workshop. Then a pilot. Two twins. One reason to meet.
